invariant: INV-43
file: p256_wide_verify.c
catches: p256_verify_equiv_test
reason: the host verifier multiplies G by u2 and the key by u1, so no
  signature a signer wrote verifies. bin/p256_verify_equiv_test requires
  the 32-bit verifier's verdict on signatures p256_sign.c wrote and on
  ones the test computed.

--- old
    p256_wide_jacobian_double_mul(&sum, &u1, &u2, &key);
--- new
    p256_wide_jacobian_double_mul(&sum, &u2, &u1, &key);
